[engl]
{100}{}{none}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Start}
{1020}{}{Quest ongoing}
{2000}{}{Thank Dharma you're here wanderer. My girl . . . uh, Tandi, Aradesh's daughter, has been kidnapped. We believe the raiders have her.}
{2010}{}{Where are these raiders?}
{2020}{}{Wow. Tough break. Well, I'll see you later.}
{2030}{}{I'm sorry, I wish I could help.}
{3000}{}{Where's Tandi? Why haven't you rescued her?}
{3010}{}{How much is this job worth to you?}
{3020}{}{I decided the little tramp wasn't worth the risk.}
{3030}{}{I need more supplies before I can tackle those guys.}
{4000}{}{Bastard!}
{5000}{}{They're to the southeast. Please, hurry. I don't know what they'll do to her.}
{5010}{}{Okay, I'll get her back for you.}
{6000}{}{I knew you were a heartless mercenary. We'll pay you well for saving her, rest assured.}
{6010}{}{If you're not going to tell me how much you'll give me, I'm not going to take the job.}
{7000}{}{Alright, I'll take care of it for you.}

